{
     "title":{
        "translate": "djzc.type_ltjd",
        "fallback":"航空兵",
        "color":"aqua",
        "hover_event": {
            "action": "show_text",
            "value": {
                "translate": "djzc.dialog.author_write",
                "fallback": "%1$s 编写",
                "with":[
                    {
                    "translate":"djzc.dialog.author2",
                    "fallback":"Deepseek"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
     },
     "pause": false,
     "type":"dialog_list",
     "body":[
        {
            "type":"plain_message",
            "contents":{
                "translate": "djzc.wiki_ltjd_1",
                "fallback": "立体机动装置：BUG堆里飞起来的天空，终于等到了机场",
                "color": "yellow"
            },
            "width": 500
        },
        {
        "type": "plain_message",
        "width": 300,
        "contents":[
            {
                "translate": "djzc.wiki_ltjd_2",
                "fallback": "栋设计的。他是冬战第四个兵种，唯一需要杀五个人才能解锁的单位——1.0.7顺手修好了代码里那个“差一人”的老毛病。这不是门槛，这是敬意。"
            }
        ]
        },
        {
        "type": "plain_message",
        "width": 300,
        "contents":[
            {
                "translate": "djzc.wiki_ltjd_3",
                "fallback": "最早的立体机动，只有弩箭和%1$s。后来有了导弹，也有了冬战史上最多的BUG——导弹追着自己人炸过，近炸引信该响不响过，发射器切模式切到死循环过。1.0.7把%1$s整个重做了：%2$s发射、命中即爆，范围够大、伤害够狠，还不误伤队友，也进了机场补给。玩家许愿是有用的。",
                "with": [
                    {
                        "translate": "djzc.rocket_ltjd",
                        "fallback": "雷枪",
                        "color": "aqua",
                        "italic": true
                    },
                    {
                        "keybind": "key.use",
                        "color": "gold",
                        "bold": true
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
        },
        {
        "type": "plain_message",
        "width": 300,
        "contents":[
            {
                "translate": "djzc.wiki_ltjd_4",
                "fallback": "CE说，未来要给他找个机场。机场已经找到了：在己方机场待一会儿，导弹、%1$s和烟花火箭都会补给；敌方机场还会用防空导弹欢迎你。他甚至还混进了一个预设——陆战-鹰击长空，和%2$s一起把天空包场。至于%3$s的三连发重置，还记在待定事项里。但没关系，在那个命令方块铺满地图的年代，是他第一次让冬战的玩家抬起头，看见天空也是战场。",
                "with": [
                    {
                        "translate": "djzc.rocket_ltjd",
                        "fallback": "雷枪",
                        "color": "aqua",
                        "italic": true
                    },
                    {
                        "translate": "djzc.type_bzb",
                        "fallback": "板载兵",
                        "color": "aqua",
                        "italic": true
                    },
                    {
                        "translate": "djzc.sanlian_fly",
                        "fallback": "一键三连·航空版",
                        "color": "aqua",
                        "italic": true
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
        },
        {
            "type": "item",
            "width": 100,
            "item": {
                "id": "elytra",
                "components": {
                    "enchantments": {
                        "mending": 1,
                        "unbreaking": 3
                    },
                    "unbreakable": {},
                    "custom_name": {
                        "translate":"djzc.elytra_ltjd",
                        "fallback":"立体机动装置（伪）",
                        "italic": true
                    },
